      "classMechanic_text": "",
      "class_lore": "<blockquote><p><strong>Weaponmasters</strong> spend years upon years honing their close combat arts. Most of them display remarkable skill with a variety of weapons; others have trained to become one with a specific armament. Many Weaponmasters follow and protect someone out of love or loyalty, but there are also those who tirelessly wander the world seeking worthy opponents, legendary magical weapons, or capable teachers.</p></blockquote>",
